sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant PD as Pro Desk Associate
  participant WB as Workbench
  participant NX as Nexus ∞
  participant CRM as Infinity CRM
  participant SF as Salesforce CRM
  participant LC as Compliance Guard
  participant LK as LiveKit
  participant SIP as SIP Trunk (Twilio/Telnyx)
  participant PSTN as Customer Phone
  participant PC as Pipecat / Cortex ∞
  participant M as Memory / Context Store

  PD->>WB: Open AINTC account list
  WB->>CRM: Pull eligible accounts + promotion context
  CRM-->>WB: Account, contact, prior engagement, promo details
  WB->>NX: Start outbound engagement
  NX->>LC: Check DNC, consent, timezone, attempt limit
  LC-->>NX: Approved
  NX->>CRM: Create engagement record in "In Progress"
  NX->>LK: Create LiveKit room + session metadata
  NX->>SIP: Dial customer via PSTN trunk
  SIP->>PSTN: Ring customer phone
  PSTN-->>SIP: Customer answers
  SIP-->>LK: Bridge call into LiveKit room
  LK->>PC: Stream audio with transport context = pstn
  PC->>M: Load customer profile + promotion context
  PC->>PC: STT + intent + objection detection + response generation
  PC-->>LK: TTS response / coaching signal
  LK-->>PSTN: Audio back to customer
  PSTN-->>PD: Customer hears promotion pitch

  alt Customer interested
    PC-->>NX: high_intent / callback_request
    NX->>WB: Prompt associate with next best action
    PD->>WB: Log notes + schedule follow-up
    WB->>CRM: Sync engagement + outcome
    WB->>SF: Sync if required
  else Customer not interested
    PC-->>NX: low_intent / no_follow_up
    NX->>WB: Suggest disposition and closeout
    PD->>WB: Mark disposition
    WB->>CRM: Update outcome + transcript key
    WB->>SF: Sync if required
  else Voicemail detected
    PC-->>NX: voicemail_detected
    NX->>SIP: End call / drop voicemail if policy allows
    NX->>WB: Show voicemail disposition + CTA
    PD->>WB: Save outcome
    WB->>CRM: Update record and retry schedule
  end